const spell=[['hope + ful','hopeful','hopefull','hopful'],['care + ful','careful','carefull','carful'],['happy + ness','happiness','happyness','hapiness'],['easy + ly','easily','easyly','easely'],['busy + er','busier','busyer','bussier'],['make + ing','making','makeing','makking'],['plan + ed','planned','planed','plannedd'],['stop + ing','stopping','stoping','stopeing'],['try + ed','tried','tryed','tryd'],['use + less','useless','usless','uselesss'],['beauty + ful','beautiful','beautyful','beautifull'],['multiply + ed','multiplied','multiplyed','multiplid'],['permit + ed','permitted','permited','permitteed'],['refer + ing','referring','refering','referrring'],['possible + ly','possibly','possiblely','posibly'],['decide + ing','deciding','decideing','decidding'],['argue + ment','argument','arguement','arggument'],['occur + ed','occurred','occured','occurrd'],['carry + ing','carrying','carriing','carryying'],['apply + ation','application','applyation','aplication']];
reg('spell4','Spelling Changes','철자 고치기','3-5.F.P.4',(i,lv)=>{if(lv===2){const r=spell[10+i],sent=['The painting is ___.','We ___ the number by three.','The teacher ___ us to enter.','I am ___ to that earlier point.','We can ___ finish today.','She is ___ which route to take.','Each side gave an ___.','The change ___ yesterday.','He is ___ the bag now.','Please complete the ___.'][i];return item(B('Use the word parts to complete the sentence with correct spelling.','낱말 조각과 문맥을 함께 보고 올바른 철자로 빈칸을 채워요.'),sent+'\n'+r[0],r[1],r.slice(2));}return bank(spell,i,lv,B('Join the parts and make the needed spelling change.','낱말 조각을 합치면서 필요한 철자도 고쳐요.'));},'write');
const phrases=[['After the rain, the path shone.','After the rain / the path shone.','After / the rain the path shone.','After the rain the / path shone.'],['Before the show, we checked the lights.','Before the show / we checked the lights.','Before / the show we checked the lights.','Before the show we checked / the lights.'],['With a quiet voice, the guide welcomed us.','With a quiet voice / the guide welcomed us.','With a / quiet voice the guide welcomed us.','With a quiet voice the guide / welcomed us.'],['During the break, we shared our drawings.','During the break / we shared our drawings.','During the / break we shared our drawings.','During the break we / shared our drawings.'],['Under the bridge, a stream flowed.','Under the bridge / a stream flowed.','Under / the bridge a stream flowed.','Under the bridge a / stream flowed.'],['When the doors opened, the visitors entered.','When the doors opened / the visitors entered.','When the / doors opened the visitors entered.','When the doors opened the / visitors entered.'],['At the far end, a lamp glowed.','At the far end / a lamp glowed.','At the far / end a lamp glowed.','At the far end a / lamp glowed.'],['After the final note, everyone clapped.','After the final note / everyone clapped.','After the final / note everyone clapped.','After the final note everyone / clapped.'],['Before sunrise, the kitchen was busy.','Before sunrise / the kitchen was busy.','Before / sunrise the kitchen was busy.','Before sunrise the / kitchen was busy.'],['Near the old gate, a dog waited.','Near the old gate / a dog waited.','Near / the old gate a dog waited.','Near the old gate a / dog waited.'],['I asked for the BLUE folder, not the red one.','The color matters.','The owner matters.','The number matters.'],['WE carried the box; the adults watched.','Who carried it matters.','The box color matters.','The time of day matters.'],['The train arrives TODAY, not tomorrow.','The arrival day matters.','The train length matters.','The ticket color matters.'],['She BORROWED the book; she did not buy it.','How she got it matters.','The book cover matters.','The author matters.'],['Only TWO chairs fit here, not three.','The number matters.','The chair material matters.','Who owns them matters.'],['Please close the WINDOW, not the door.','Which opening matters.','Who built it matters.','When it was made matters.'],['The bag is UNDER the desk, not on it.','Its location matters.','Its size matters.','Its owner matters.'],['He walked SLOWLY so the water would not spill.','The pace matters.','The shirt color matters.','The cup pattern matters.'],['The SMALL box fits; the large one does not.','The size matters.','The delivery day matters.','The label matters.'],['I said MAY, not must; you have a choice.','Permission matters.','The calendar month matters.','The speaker age matters.']];
