const structures=[['First fold the card. Next cut a window. Finally add a label.','sequence','comparison','problem and solution'],['Heavy rain filled the drain. Water spread across the path as a result.','cause and effect','comparison','alphabetical list'],['Both bags carry books. One has wheels; the other has straps.','comparison','time sequence','cause and effect'],['The sign was too small to read. The team made a larger one.','problem and solution','alphabetical list','comparison'],['First rinse the brush, then squeeze out water, and finally dry it.','sequence','comparison','problem and solution'],['The lamp went out because its battery ran down.','cause and effect','comparison','time sequence'],['A paper folder is light. A plastic one resists water better. Both hold pages.','comparison','chronology','instructions'],['Loose pages fell out. Adding a clip kept them together.','problem and solution','comparison','alphabetical list'],['The wind pushed the sail, so the boat moved.','cause and effect','comparison','alphabetical list'],['First label samples. Then measure each one. Record results last.','sequence','comparison','problem and solution'],['A: Cloth bends; a stiff box stacks well. Both hold supplies. B: Supplies fell out, so we added a lid.','A compares; B solves a problem.','Both only show time order.','A gives a cause; B only compares.'],['A: Thick rope holds more than thin string. B: The string snapped, making the model fall.','A compares; B explains cause and effect.','Both give instructions.','A shows time order; B compares.'],['A: Plant the seed, water it, and place it near light. B: Dry soil lacked water, so the seedling wilted.','A gives steps; B explains cause and effect.','Both compare plants.','A explains a problem; B gives steps.'],['A: Noise made listening hard. We moved to a quiet room. B: The new room is smaller but quieter.','A solves a problem; B compares.','Both only show time order.','A compares; B solves a problem.'],['A: A closed vent trapped warm air. B: Opening the vent reduced the heat problem.','A explains a cause; B offers a solution.','Both only compare sizes.','Both list unrelated facts.'],['A: Draw a plan, gather supplies, then build. B: Paper folds easily; wood holds more weight.','A gives steps; B compares.','Both describe one problem.','A compares; B gives steps.'],['A: A new handle made the cart usable. B: The broken handle stopped anyone from pulling the cart.','A gives a solution; B explains an effect.','Both give full instructions.','Both compare two carts.'],['A: Small labels fit more closely. B: Small labels were unreadable, so we made larger ones.','A compares; B solves a problem.','Both show one sequence.','A solves a problem; B compares.'],['A: Ice melted when the room warmed. B: Place ice, then record its size each minute.','A explains a cause; B gives steps.','Both compare materials.','A gives steps; B explains a cause.'],['A: People got lost. An arrow helped. B: An arrow was easier to follow than a paragraph.','A solves a problem; B compares.','Both only list dates.','A compares; B gives instructions.']];
